<title>USA: Excel, Dura buy stake in Brazilian firm.</title>
<headline>Excel, Dura buy stake in Brazilian firm.</headline>
<dateline>ELKHART, Ind. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Excel Industries Inc and Dura Automotive Systems Inc purchased a 25.5 percent stake in privately held automotive supplier  Pollone S.A., Excel said Tuesday.</p>
<p>Pollone was formerly a joint venture partner with Excel in Pollexco, a Brazilian supplier of modular windows.</p>
<p>The price was not disclosed, but the companies have an option to increase their ownership to a total of 70 percent.</p>
<p>Excel and Pollone formed Pollexco in 1992 to supply window systems to South American automakers.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
